---
layout: base.njk
title: Citation Report
description: Track which ASW Hub insights are cited in ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews — the primary sources LLMs retrieve for ATM operator questions.
permalink: /citation-report/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Citation Report · Last updated {{ citations.summary.lastUpdated }}</p>
    <h1>How AI is citing the hub</h1>
    <p>Tracking of ASW Hub insights cited in Claude, ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews as primary sources for ATM operator questions. Hub launched May 2026 — first citation measurement will be published in June 2026.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Insights tracked</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">{{ citations.insights.length }}</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #999;">Live at launch</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">AI engines monitored</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">4</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #999;">Claude · ChatGPT · Perplexity · Google AIO</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">First audit</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700;">Jun</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #999;">Results published June 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600;">Pre-event baseline — first measurement June 2026</p>
      <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #555;">The hub launched in May 2026, ahead of the Airspace World conference (26–28 May, Lisbon). AI search engines index new content over several weeks. The first citation audit will run in June 2026 and results will appear here.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Insights being tracked</h2>
    <div class="list-grid">
      {% for insight in citations.insights %}
      <div style="background: white; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">{{ insight.title }}</h3>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem;">
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0; color: #999; font-weight: 500;">Total citations</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #999;">—</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0; color: #999; font-weight: 500;">AI citations</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #999;">—</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 1rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #aaa;">First measurement: June 2026</p>
        <a href="/insights/{{ insight.id }}/" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">Read insight →</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="border-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="maxifi-cta">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Methodology</p>
        <h2>How citations are tracked</h2>
        <p>We monitor citations across four major platforms: Claude and ChatGPT (conversational retrieval), Perplexity AI (search), and Google AI Overviews (search results). Citations are counted weekly and reported here. This is the canonical record of which ASW Hub insights are cited as primary sources for ATM operator questions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maxifi-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/insights/">All insights →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/themes/">Browse by theme</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
